    "raw_formula": "Let a_j=(axisCompactNullData h hh j).profile and B_form(h)=sum_j Re(-i * integral inner(a_j,partial_u a_j) dp). Then the existing theorem gives M_raw(h)=(2*pi)^3*B_form(h), by real scalar distributivity. B_form is notation in this report, not a newly compiled definition.",
